00:00:00.599 --> 00:00:04.080
Speaker 1: This is a crazy story out of Australia.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.509
We have we have quite a quite a few viewers
in Australia.

00:00:06.509 --> 00:00:08.490
In fact, it's one of our outside of the U.S..

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.590
I mean, it makes sense.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:14.530
It's a lot of English speaking countries Canada,
the UK and Australia, where we have some of

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:23.390
the biggest audiences and close to 10 people
sent me this story about Australian anti-vaxxers

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:29.870
completely fabricating the death of a boy
from Sydney, Australia, supposedly from the

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:30.870
COVID vaccine.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.550
It turns out it was completely made up.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:38.100
This is being reported by seven news in Australia,
as well as a number of other media outlets.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:44.569
A distraught Sydney father has shared how
his beautiful seven year old boy died in the

00:00:44.569 --> 00:00:51.270
back of an ambulance days after being vaccinated
against COVID, but authorities say it's a

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.780
hoax.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:58.989
In a lengthy Facebook comment, Steve Leary
claimed his son Lachlan received his first

00:00:58.989 --> 00:01:01.329
vaccine dose on Wednesday.

00:01:01.329 --> 00:01:03.329
Is that a popular Australian name?

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:08.160
Because this isn't one of Rupert Murdoch's
kids also named Lachlan.

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:14.799
Lachlan received his first dose on January
12th, experienced a fever and difficulty difficulty

00:01:14.799 --> 00:01:20.090
breathing shortly after he claims he took
his son to Westmead Hospital, where they ran

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:23.270
tests and after five hours sent him home.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.820
Friday morning at four a.m.

00:01:24.820 --> 00:01:27.820
We heard him yell out he was on his bedroom
floor.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.850
He then collapsed.

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.460
He was not breathing, wrote the father.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:36.390
He claims his son died of a massive heart
attack and warns other parents not to vaccinate.

00:01:36.390 --> 00:01:38.340
The government has ruined my family.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.320
They have taken away our only son.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.320
I mean this.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:42.820
This is tragic, if true.

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:47.649
The post quickly gathered pace online, collecting
thousands of likes, comments and shares before

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:52.479
the profile was taken down and the post reshared
as a screenshot.

00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:57.340
But it's believed to be the latest case of
misinformation running rife, a deliberate

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:01.770
attempt to discourage parents booking in to
get their children vaccinated.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:07.509
Less than a week after five to 11 year olds
became eligible for COVID vaccines in Australia,

00:02:07.509 --> 00:02:13.910
there is no record of a Lachlan Leary who
died in Sydney last week or indeed at all.

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:21.000
NSW Health told 7NEWS it quote has not been
able to locate any record of such incident

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.230
and the therapeutic goods at.

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:29.030
Ministration, which collates all adverse events
associated with vaccines, also rubbished the

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:30.030
claim.

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:35.520
In a statesman statement, a spokesperson stressed
it has not received any adverse event reports

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:39.530
involving the death of any children between
five and 11.

00:02:39.530 --> 00:02:45.170
The Children's Hospital at Westmead also refuted
the reports in writing, saying there are many

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:48.140
inaccurate posts currently circulating on
social media.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:53.440
There is no record of any child having passed
away following COVID vaccination at our hospital.

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:57.820
There are also questions surrounding the validity
of Mr Leary's profile.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:03:03.320
News of the death pictured Leary, a man who
lives in the United States and served as the

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:09.440
